{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "没有走系统的指令  (An Order Off the System)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Late in the afternoon, Unit Two staffers corner Bu Xiaogu in the archive room and tell her to carry eight raw-footage hard drives out for repair without filing a system request. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们二部的硬盘坏了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们要有什么需求，直接通过办公系统下个指令。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们行政看到指令就会去办的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "既然是为了配合淳于总的工作急着要，那我下班去修吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "盛典这么大的项目，台里就不知道早一个礼拜说吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你也早点撤吧，明天还有好多事呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总觉得有什么事没做，但是又想不起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "您还会忘事呢？真是难得。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天所有工作全都检查了，肯定不是什么重要的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们先走吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们二部的硬盘坏了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are Unit Two's hard drives broken?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们要有什么需求，直接通过办公系统下个指令。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you have a request, please log an order straight through the office system.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们行政看到指令就会去办的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once admin sees the logged order, we will handle it right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "既然是为了配合淳于总的工作急着要，那我下班去修吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since it is urgent to support Mr Chun Yuqiao's work, I will take them after work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "盛典这么大的项目，台里就不知道早一个礼拜说吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On a gala project this huge, could the network not have told us a week earlier?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你也早点撤吧，明天还有好多事呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, you should head home early too; tomorrow is packed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总觉得有什么事没做，但是又想不起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I keep feeling I left something undone, yet I cannot recall what.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "您还会忘事呢？真是难得。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even you forget things? That is rare indeed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天所有工作全都检查了，肯定不是什么重要的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every task today was checked, so it surely cannot be anything major.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们先走吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You all head home first.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们二部的硬盘坏了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们要有什么需求，直接通过办公系统下个指令。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们行政看到指令就会去办的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "既然是为了配合淳于总的工作急着要，那我下班去修吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "盛典这么大的项目，台里就不知道早一个礼拜说吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你也早点撤吧，明天还有好多事呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总觉得有什么事没做，但是又想不起来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "您还会忘事呢？真是难得。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天所有工作全都检查了，肯定不是什么重要的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们先走吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Unsuspecting Xiaogu packs up the heavy hard drives after hours right as Chun Yuqiao lingers late with a nagging hunch. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
